              "title": "Adoption, tuning and verification",
              "html": "<p>Record the tool version, rule/database revision, target scope and owner with every report. Use the <a href=\"https://github.com/1ega/devsecops-for-all-dso/blob/main/integrations/README.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">starter integrations</a> where applicable; test expected findings and scanner failures before requiring a gate. Suppress only reviewed false positives with asset/rule scope, approver and expiry. Retest the deployed version, retain redacted evidence privately, and follow the <a href=\"https://github.com/1ega/devsecops-for-all-dso/blob/main/reporting/finding-lifecycle.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">finding lifecycle</a>. Missing packages, denied APIs, incomplete checkout or skipped targets are coverage gaps, not a clean scan.</p>"
